Apache Virtual Host Configuration:

Run the following commands:

sudo tee /etc/apache2/sites-available/mailcamp.conf > /dev/null <<'EOF'
<VirtualHost *:80>
    ServerName mailcamp.local
    DocumentRoot {{DOC_ROOT}}

    <Directory {{DOC_ROOT}}>
        AllowOverride All
        Require all granted
    </Directory>
</VirtualHost>
EOF

sudo a2ensite mailcamp
sudo a2enmod rewrite
sudo systemctl reload apache2

Add to /etc/hosts:
echo "127.0.0.1 mailcamp.local" | sudo tee -a /etc/hosts

Then visit: http://mailcamp.local
